# Qt 6.2's software/offscreen scene graph retains three platform pixmap textures until process
# teardown. The allocations have no cockpit frame; keep these function-specific suppressions scoped
# to cockpit_ui_qml_test in ASan builds.
leak:QImageData::create
leak:QSGTexture::QSGTexture
leak:QPlatformIntegration::createPlatformPixmap
leak:QtSharedPointer::ExternalRefCountData::getAndRef
# Ubuntu 22.04 strips the remaining 40-byte software-renderer node allocation, so LSan can only
# identify its Qt Quick DSO. This suppression remains limited to the offscreen QML test process.
leak:libQt6Quick.so.6
